@host = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@key = COLE_SUA_CHAVE_AQUI
@player = 1

### Health (público): 200
GET {{host}}/health

### Sem chave: 401
GET {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}

### Chave inválida: 401
GET {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer chave-errada

### Sem X-Player-ID: 400
GET {{host}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Listar itens: 200
GET {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Criar item: 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "health_potion", "quantity": 90}

### Criar com quantity 0: 400
POST {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "health_potion", "quantity": 0}

### Criar com kind desconhecido: 400
POST {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "nao_existe", "quantity": 1}

### Criar com JSON inválido: 400
POST {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"kind": "health_potion", "quantity":

### Criar enviando id (recusado): 400
POST {{host}}/items
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 5, "kind": "health_potion", "quantity": 1}

### Buscar item: 200
GET {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Buscar item inexistente: 404
GET {{host}}/items/99999
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Buscar item de outro jogador: 404
GET {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: 2
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Buscar com id não numérico: 400
GET {{host}}/items/abc
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Buscar item sem chave: 401
GET {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}

### Atualizar quantidade: 200
PUT {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 50}

### Atualizar acima do max_stack: 400
PUT {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 1000}

### Atualizar item inexistente: 404
PUT {{host}}/items/99999
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 5}

### Atualizar sem chave: 401
PUT {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 5}

### Excluir item: 204
DELETE {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Excluir item inexistente: 404
DELETE {{host}}/items/99999
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Excluir sem chave: 401
DELETE {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}

### Método não permitido: 405
PATCH {{host}}/items/1
X-Player-ID: {{player}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
